{"title":"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be two points in the plane. Describe the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> of all points in the plane such\nthat for any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/6/0969ddbbc6e848004f754b8efbd73eea8713260b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|PA| = 3|PB| \\text{.}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/805440e55bd062f398ab4dcf5ba7d3569e19f388.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = (0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5c2a019e2c8cad22e51ee9e46808df791c8b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = (b, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" />. That means that we have that for any point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c99a5ec75d983d80ce660dcf7ee63598c1cdeb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) \\in S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb404442f79d2e1ff39acf82ff1306b87905885.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} = 3 \\sqrt{(x - b)^2 + y^2} \\implies x^2 + y^2 = 9((x - b)^2 + y^2) \\implies x^2 + y^2 = 9x^2 - 18xb + 9b^2 + 9y^2 \\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"840\" height=\"35\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b51226268632c24c6d791f3f324d80eecfd1d9e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x^2 - 18xb + 9b^2 + 8y^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />. Conic sections written in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f0bc35bccad86b3b61316f695b93b5d69391663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + bx + cy^2 + dy + e = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"222\" height=\"20\" /> are circles if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0baced26dbcf8c61bff7cd5d6ab63bb3917e0ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = c$\" width=\"42\" height=\"8\" />, which is true in our equation. Therefore, S is a circle.\n~Puck_0\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2015 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest\" title=\"UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest\"> All UNM-PNM Problems and Solut